# Step 1
# ------
# With w = Z0 g0 (Z0 the exact inverse of J0), g0 = J0 w and
# A1 g1 = A1 g0 + A1 S1 (y1 - y0) = -A1 (S1 w - J0 w) + A1 S1 (w - v0) + A1 S1 e0
# (y1 - y0 = e0 - v0, e0 the first rounding), each term second order but
# the last, which is e0 up to A1 S1 ~ I.


